Z||000000||Philphine||08-23-2001||09:25 PM||||on my way to work at a stop light. 2 guys in a vw rabbit are trying to get my attention. <BR>"hey, is that fast?" "no, i haven't done any engine work yet." "is it a v6?" "no, just a four." "that's good, 'cause v6's burn up".<P>you know what i'm thinking. i guess it shows on my face when i don't say anything. "it's true", he says after a moment. i still don't say anything till he asks if it's an '84. "no an '87". at that point he just says nice car and they roll the window back up.<P>i can't see the point of arguing for clarification or just for arguements sake. it's a waste of my time.<P> isn't it wierd to run into people who think they know so much about a car they don't have?<P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>a man of constant sorrow||||reg||1
